Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 01:24:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix: Docker + env configuration fixes for local
 development

Issues fixed:
1. Dockerfile: GD extension built with --with-freetype --with-jpeg for PHP 8.4+
2. Dockerfile: Added Node.js 20 for Vite frontend asset builds
3. entrypoint.sh: Rewrote admin user creation using raw PHP/PDO instead of unreliable tinker --execute
4. entrypoint.sh: Added automatic .env file creation inside container
5. entrypoint.sh: Added npm install + vite build step for frontend assets
6. entrypoint.sh: Fixed storage/framework/cache/data directory creation
7. docker-compose.yml: Removed unused legacy/public nginx volume mount
8. nginx/default.conf: Removed legacy/public dependency, added /build/ for Vite assets
9. session.php: SESSION_SECURE_COOKIE default changed true->false for HTTP dev
10. .env.example: SESSION_SECURE_COOKIE changed true->false
11. laravel/.gitignore: Added node_modules/, public/build/, .env exclusions
12. Created database/seeders/ and public/build/.gitkeep
13. DOCKER_README.md: Updated repo URL to match actual repo name
