+#
+# IMPORTANT: Uses resolver directive + variable for PHP-FPM upstream.
+# This prevents nginx from crashing at startup if the rcerp_app container
+# isn't ready yet. The DNS resolution happens per-request instead.
 # =============================================================================
 
